/*
 * Real platform marks, not abstract UI glyphs (see Icon.astro for those).
 * Paths are copied verbatim from the actual client picker at
 * clients/tv-web/web/src/pages/Clients.tsx (`ClientPlatformIcon`): Simple
 * Icons brand paths (CC0-1.0, no attribution required) for android, apple,
 * lg, samsung, roku and harmony, and that page's own hand-drawn VIDAA mark.
 * "web" is this site's own generic browser-window glyph (Playarr's web
 * client isn't tied to one browser, so it gets no brand mark of its own).
 * Deliberately excludes that page's Xbox icon (Font Awesome Free, CC BY 4.0,
 * requires attribution) since Xbox isn't one of this site's PLATFORMS.
 */
